EllesmereUIFriends.lua

# No friend groups on 12.1: every renderer for them tainted BNet whispers
# (proven by bisect: mutating the friends list data in any form -- our rows,
# our element data, or merely re-parenting Blizzard's own nodes -- taints the
# execution Blizzard's secure OnClick needs, and SetTellTarget's whisper target
# is a secret value there). The old EUI_Friends_Groups_121.lua left the repo;
# git history keeps it.

